{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":185404,"duration_api_ms":183199,"num_turns":26,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a31094d1-4868-4a75-906a-def9dd00baaa","total_cost_usd":1.09938,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":67340,"cache_read_input_tokens":1056190,"output_tokens":6013,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":67340},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":6013,"cacheReadInputTokens":1056190,"cacheCreationInputTokens":67340,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.09938,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 6 shrimp probe tests pass: `test result: ok. 6 passed; 0 failed` — 5 individual probes + all_shrimp_probes_summary runner.","AC1 (5 named tests with doc comments): Confirmed — probe_successful_breeding (line 205), probe_thermal_suppression (line 464), probe_chemistry_stress (line 726), probe_chloride_protection (line 904), probe_crash_mode (line 1194) each have multi-line doc comments explaining the husbandry story being validated.","AC2 (failure dumps per-stage shrimp state and water chemistry per tick): Confirmed — emit_tick_snapshot (engine.rs:116-212) emits per-tick structured notes for adult/sub_adult/juvenile counts, condition, and reserve_g individually, plus berried_females, molt_stress, molt_readiness, failed_molt_accum, last_molt_success, reproductive_readiness, and water chemistry (GH, pH, NO2, Cl, DO, temp) gated at Verbosity::Trace. shrimp_diag() (lines 157-188) formats all per-stage data into failure messages.","AC3 (e2e script with summary, structured traces, non-zero exit on envelope violation): Confirmed — all_shrimp_probes_summary (line 1358) runs all 5 probes via catch_unwind, prints PASS/FAIL per probe with observed metrics, persists trace.jsonl artifacts for summary runs, and panics (non-zero exit) via line 1420 on any failure. Test output shows 8 trace artifact files persisted.","AC4 (directional/envelope assertions, no frozen exact counts): Confirmed — all probes use directional comparisons (<, >, >=, <=) and Envelope ranges (pH 6.8-8.6, temp 23-26.5, TAN 0-0.6, NO2 0-0.6, DO min 7.0, etc.). No exact count assertions.","AC5 (breeding 1000+ hours with 2+ cycles): Confirmed — 60 days x 24h = 1440 hours, event-backed ShrimpBerried/ShrimpHatched counting via BTreeSet (lines 271-283), complete_cycle_count >= 2 assertion at line 295. Test output shows cycles=10, berried_days=19, hatch_days=10, population 10->260.","Clippy: `cargo clippy -p tank_harness --test e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes -- -D warnings` passes with zero warnings.","All 23 tracing tests pass including trace_verbosity_reports_tick_snapshot_for_shrimp_probe_debugging.","Amendment fr-5-dde06aca (stale pH in fixtures) applied: resolve_carbonate_state(&mut state.water, vol) confirmed at lines 389, 493, 760, 1006, 1223 — all five fixtures now re-solve carbonate equilibrium after custom overrides and before reseed_stability_tracker().","Breeding probe uses event-driven cycle counting via BTreeSet of berried_days and hatch_days from EventKind events (lines 271-283), with complete_cycle_count = berried_days.len().min(hatch_days.len()). Output: cycles=10, population 10->260.","Thermal suppression: cool arm (25°C) reuses breeding_success_state fixture, warm arm (31°C) starts with seeded berried females and prev_temp_c=25 for heat shock. Cool arm finishes healthy (cond=0.918, molt_stress=0.005, 258 juveniles, 11 hatches), warm arm shows suppression (readiness=0.017, 0 juveniles, 0 hatches, 1 egg drop). Cool-control health guard requires hatch evidence.","Chemistry stress: low GH (Ca 5 mg/L, Mg 2 mg/L) + high NO2 (4 mg N/L), adults seeded at end of intermolt cycle (lines 785-786), colony collapses 20->0, molt_failures=1, failed_molt_accum=0.300.","Chloride protection: real 3-phase branched design — 3 days pre-treatment crisis, state cloned into salt-treated (200 mg/L Cl) and matched-control branches with 50% water changes, 3-day recovery. Output: treated_deaths=0 < control_deaths=3, treated_hazard=0.3518 < control_hazard=4.3736.","Crash mode: 40 shrimp in ~15L, 1g/day overfeeding, no water changes for 30 days. Colony crashes 40->0 (100% mortality), TAN=77.068, NO2=12.774, DO=8.04, cond=0.000.","Summary runner persists trace.jsonl artifacts with deterministic paths for all 8 runs (breeding, 2 thermal arms, chemistry, 3 chloride branches, crash)."],"findings_or_gaps":["Pre-existing clippy warnings in e2e_geometry_scaling.rs (manual_range_contains) and calibration_report.rs (needless_borrows_for_generic_args) are outside this deliverable's scope.","Unstaged changes in crates/tank_harness/src/calibration.rs from a different project (tanksim-6e5.7.3) modify FieldCheck to use Option<f64>; these are outside this deliverable's scope and were correctly left untouched.","Two pre-existing test failures in tank_data::presets (from unstaged tanksim-6e5.7.2 param_meta changes to default.toml) remain outside this deliverable's scope.","The thermal-suppression probe depends on seeded berried females plus a first-day 25->31°C heat shock; substantial future retunes to hatch timing or thermal egg-drop behavior may require fixture adjustment, but this is acceptable coupling given the scenario's purpose."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b9137aac-d266-4d40-b6af-1244d9add94d"}
